  "description": "The God who rules over the vast world of 'Rodowan' one day announces a new Divine Law: All reproduction is immediately prohibited.\n\nThose who are banned from conceiving rebel for the sake of humankind and their children, but the power of God and their followers is overwhelming and oppressive.\n\nGod brands children born after the Divine Law as children of traitors, killing them or turning them into slaves.\n\nIn this chaotic world, those who wish to punish this sick tyranny begin their desperate fight.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
